REGISTER:
Client
  ↓
POST /auth/register
  ↓
AuthController
  ↓
@Valid RegisterRequest
  ↓
AuthService
  ↓
PasswordEncoder (BCrypt)
  ↓
UserRepository
  ↓
PostgreSQL

LOGIN:
POST /auth/login
        ↓
AuthController
        ↓
AuthService.login()
        ↓
Validate password
        ↓
JwtService.generateToken()
        ↓
Return JWT

Authentication Flow
JWT token
   ↓
Extract email
   ↓
CustomUserDetailsService.loadUserByUsername(email)
   ↓
UserRepository.findByEmail(email)
   ↓
Return UserDetails

Client
  ↓
Authorization: Bearer <jwt>
  ↓
JwtAuthenticationFilter
  ↓
JwtService validates token
  ↓
Extract email
  ↓
CustomUserDetailsService loads user
  ↓
SecurityContextHolder stores authentication
  ↓
AuthController.me()

